  "notes": [
    "Browser captures ran from the original checkout after sequentially rebuilding shared packages, renderer and preparation entry points. No full-site build was repeated.",
    "The successful browser run predates the helper-only codeRevision field; its exact helper is retained as browser-check-used.mjs.txt. Application sources were clean at the recorded revision.",
    "Only selected transports and runtime assets were restored. Source acquisition reused hash-verified common sky/font files through hard links and restored missing published papers through the standard acquisition implementation.",
    "The earlier 942-page production build completed at the prepared-data revision; its output was removed during workstation cleanup. These retained screenshots and traces qualify the development server, not a newly rebuilt production site.",
    "No geometry rebake or exact-output reproduction comparison was repeated. Source/runtime closures and numerical fit are distinct checks."
